:: Widgets Fishing Forest Lake Catch [widget]
<<widget "fishingForestLakePulledIn">>
	The <<print $fishingHookedFish.type>> pulls harder. <span class="red">Your feet slip on the wet rock and it drags you into the lake,</span> though you keep hold of your rod as you go under.<<gstress>><<stress 4>>
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Lake Depths]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "fishingForestLakeLineSnapped">>
	Your line goes taut, then <span class="red">snaps.</span> The <<print $fishingHookedFish.type>> is gone.
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Re-hook the line and cast back out (0:03)|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "reHook">><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Lake Fishing Rock]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</widget>>

:: Fishing Forest Lake Catch
<<effects>>
<<run updateFishRecord($fishingHookedFish.type, $fishingHookedFish.size, $bus)>>
<<run stopFishingProp()>>
<<set _fishPropName to "caught-" + $fishingHookedFish.type>>
<<wearProp _fishPropName>>
<<set _canEatFish to canEatFishTf($fishingHookedFish)>>

<<fishingCatchFishText $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<if _canEatFish>>
	It's such a small fish, you could probably fit the whole thing in your mouth.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [["Stow the " + $fishingHookedFish.type + " away"|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Throw it back|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
<<if _canEatFish>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Eat the fish|Fishing Forest Lake Cat Eat]]>><</link>><<cat>>
<</if>>
